[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛想到去淋浴房看看，<br>是因为她在找能冲水的地方。|#0102Adv24_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（凶手刺杀米莉亚的时候<br>　应该被溅到了血）|#0102Adv24_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（哪怕没有被溅一身，<br>　至少手上肯定有沾到）|#0102Adv24_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（凶手一定得洗掉血迹，<br>　所以她应该去过淋浴房——）|#0102Adv24_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛走进去一看，<br>只见亚里沙在翻看淋浴房的衣柜，<br>她大概也作出了同样的推测。|#0102Adv24_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，樱羽，你来得正好。|#0102Adv24_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙看到艾玛来了，便走过去。|#0102Adv24_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:我检查了一遍所有囚犯的衣柜。<br>然后发现了这个，看。|#0102Adv24_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ==============================================================================
; ☆証拠品：『桜羽エマのスマホ』入手
; ==============================================================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:2-7
@UpdateWitchBook Id:2-7 Category:Clue Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:咦，我的手机……！？|#0102Adv24_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你洗澡的时候丢在这里了吧。<br>就放在你的衣柜里。|#0102Adv24_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:呃、嗯，可能是。|#0102Adv24_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你小心点啊。要是放进衣服里没拿出来<br>可就要弄丢了。|#0102Adv24_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:淋浴房的衣柜里<br>每天都会放进全新的囚服和内衣。|#0102Adv24_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:旧衣服必须扔进<br>垃圾滑槽丢掉。|#0102Adv24_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（好险……我记得衣服会被烧掉吧）|#0102Adv24_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:顺便一提，所有人的衣柜我都检查了一遍，<br>今天大家应该都洗过澡了。<br>除了佐伯的柜子以外都是空的。|#0102Adv24_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:是吗……除此以外你还发现了什么？|#0102Adv24_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙不甘心地摇摇头。|#0102Adv24_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:什么都没有……该死。|#0102Adv24_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:我头脑不好，怎么可能知道凶手是谁！<br>凭什么非要叫我们找凶手！|#0102Adv24_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这不是让我们把彼此当敌人吗！|#0102Adv24_Alisa008| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:那悲痛的呐喊听得艾玛咬紧了嘴唇。|#0102Adv24_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（亚里沙说得没错……<br>　为什么一定得怀疑别人……？<br>　这样是不对的……）|#0102Adv24_Ema008|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙正怒上心头，<br>艾玛没法再和她继续对话，便离开了淋浴房。|#0102Adv24_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

